### then call A8 to confirm chain is broken
###
### sqlite3 command to tamper (run in terminal):
###   sqlite3 .data/arcclaw.db
###   DROP TRIGGER IF EXISTS prevent_audit_update;
###   UPDATE audit_event SET event_detail='INJECTED' WHERE sequence=2
###     AND session_id='<createSession.response.body.sessionId>';
###   .quit
### Then restart app to reinstall triggers, then hit A8.
### ============================================================

