POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{hitlSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run-async
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
  "goal": "List the rsrini7/arcclaw repository using the github tool",
  "agentRole": "coordinator",
  "maxIterations": 3
}

###

### P36-3. Check status — expect AWAITING_APPROVAL before approving
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{hitlSession.response.body.sessionId}}/status/coordinator
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### P36-4. REST APPROVE — new Phase 36 endpoint
# Expect: 200 {"sessionId":"...","decision":"APPROVED","message":"..."}
